WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.740
She can say one sentence six different ways and still say nothing.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.720
She's unburdened by what has been,

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.840
mostly because she never explained what it was in the first place.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.000
She laughs before she answers a question,

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.400
and sometimes that's the whole answer.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.660
She starts by saying,

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:23.000
let me be clear, and then isn't,

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:26.160
and somehow circles back to let me be clear.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:29.560
She says moving forward so often,

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.620
Her podium is on wheels.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:35.620
She talks about the significance of the passage of time,

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.520
so long you actually feel it passing.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:44.840
She once defined time by saying it's the thing that passes over time.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.200
Her teleprompter doesn't scroll,

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:51.020
it just loops the same line until everyone forgets the question.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:55.340
She once gave a speech about the importance of speeches.

00:00:55.340 --> 00:01:02.540
She once said holistically so many times in one speech the audience reached enlightenment.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:07.840
Her laugh comes out at the exact moment everyone else stops laughing.

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:14.600
She preaches that it's time for us to do what we have been doing, and that time is every day.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.280
She once explained water for 12 minutes straight.

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:23.640
She once explained school buses to a room full of bus drivers,

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:28.780
And the only thing they understood is that they are big and yellow.

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:33.060
She leaves people more confused than before she started talking.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:35.600
Her speeches are so repetitive.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:40.700
After she's done with a campaign, every parrot in town can recite them.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:46.480
She can redefine a word six times before anyone realizes she never defined it.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:52.260
She only answers pre-scripted questions and if someone dares to ask a real question,

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:55.940
She starts laughing until someone comes and saves her.

00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:01.020
Her press conferences end with reporters forgetting what they even asked.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:07.300
She once explained democracy as the thing we do when we do democracy.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:12.180
When she runs out of things to say, she'll talk about how she just fell out of a coconut

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:13.340
tree.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:17.020
She laughs the hardest right after saying the least.

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:20.500
She is the most word salad woman in the world.
